          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. The shadow of a ball is formed on a wall by placing the ball in front of a fixed torch as shown in Fig. 11.18. In scenario (i) the ball is closer to the torch, while in scenario (ii) the ball is closer to the wall. Choose the most accurate representation of the shadows formed in both scenarios from the options provided (a and b)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.491,
            0.623,
            0.857,
            0.696
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. Based on Fig. 11.18, match the position of the torch in Column A with the characteristics of the ball’s shadow in Column B."
            }
          ]
        },
