                0.884
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_13_table_18.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tr><td>Column A</td><td>Column B</td></tr><tr><td>If the torch is close to the ball</td><td>The shadow would be smaller</td></tr><tr><td>If the torch is far away</td><td>The shadow would be larger</td></tr><tr><td>If the ball is removed from the set-up</td><td>Two shadows would appear on the screen</td></tr><tr><td>If two torches are present in the set-up on the left side of the ball</td><td>A bright spot would appear on the screen</td></tr></table>"
